<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish June non-EU exports 763.4 mln punts - CSO.</title>
<headline>Irish June non-EU exports 763.4 mln punts - CSO.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's exports to countries outside the European Union rose to a seasonally-adjusted 763.4 million Irish pounds in June from 709.9 million in May, the Central Statistics Office (CSO) said on Monday.</p>
<p>Imports from non-EU countries rose to a seasonally-adjusted 676.3 million punts from 601.0 million in May, the CSO said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
